    "name": "🚀 Learning NestJS API",
    "description": "# 🚀 Learning NestJS API Collection\n\nComprehensive API documentation and test suite for the **Learning NestJS** backend with **PostgreSQL** and **TypeORM**.\n\n---\n\n### ⚙️ Variables\n* `baseUrl`: `http://localhost:3000/api`\n\n### 📂 Modules\n1. **📦 Products:** Full CRUD connected to PostgreSQL via TypeORM.\n2. **👥 Users:** User management endpoints.\n3. **⭐ Reviews:** Product review endpoints.\n4. **🌐 System:** App health & welcome endpoint.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "📦 Products",
      "description": "Endpoints for managing products stored in PostgreSQL database via TypeORM.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "📦 Get All Products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 📦 Get All Products\nFetches a list of all products from the PostgreSQL database along with matching reviews.\n\n* **Method:** `GET`\n* **URL:** `{{baseUrl}}/products`\n* **Success Response:** `200 OK`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "🔍 Get Product By ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/:id",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products",
                ":id"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "b1111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
                  "description": "Product UUID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 🔍 Get Product By ID\nFetches a single product by its unique integer identifier.\n\n* **Method:** `GET`\n* **URL:** `{{baseUrl}}/products/:id`\n* **Throws:** `404 Not Found` if product does not exist."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "✨ Create Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Gaming Keyboard RGB\",\n  \"description\": \"Mechanical gaming keyboard with high-precision blue switches and RGB illumination.\",\n  \"price\": 120\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### ✨ Create Product\nCreates a new product record in PostgreSQL.\n\n* **Method:** `POST`\n* **URL:** `{{baseUrl}}/products`\n* **Body Validation:**\n  * `title`: String (3 - 30 chars, required)\n  * `description`: String (5 - 500 chars, required)\n  * `price`: Number (>= 0, required)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
