              ],
              "path": [
                "users",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 🔐 Register User\nRegisters a new user account with hashed password and confirms password match.\n\n* **Method:** `POST`\n* **URL:** `{{baseUrl}}/users/auth/register`\n* **Body Validation:**\n  * `username`: String (3 - 30 chars, required)\n  * `email`: Valid email format (required)\n  * `password`: String (min 6 chars, required)\n  * `confirmPassword`: Must match password (required)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "🔑 Login User",
