            "description": "### 🔑 Login User\nAuthenticates an existing user by email and password.\n\n* **Method:** `POST`\n* **URL:** `{{baseUrl}}/users/auth/login`\n* **Body Validation:**\n  * `email`: Valid email format (required)\n  * `password`: String (required)"
          },
          "response": []
